<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,034.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,034.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Oct 8 , Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,034 today from 1,049 on Oct 7 , with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route			  Index    Rate    Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1   US GULF/ARA	  1072     9.729    1049     9.521</p>
<p>   1a  TRANSATLANTIC RV   0891  6750.000    0890  6743.000</p>
<p>   2   US GULF/JAPAN	1410    20.143    1401    20.014</p>
<p>   2a  SKAW P/USG/F EAST  1138  9336.000    1138  9336.000</p>
<p>   3   NOPAC/JAPAN	  1192    10.993    1187    10.950</p>
<p>   3a  JAPAN-SK/NOPAC/RV  0913  7207.000    0900  7100.000</p>
<p>   6   HR OR HR-RB/JAPAN  1106    11.413    1108    11.425</p>
<p>   7   HR/ROTTERDAM	 1009     4.913    1010     4.919</p>
<p>   8   QLAND/ROTTERDAM    0697     7.669    0703     7.725</p>
<p>   9   FE/NOPAC/SKAW-P    0453  3964.000    0450  3936.000</p>
